Martin '''"Mutilator"''' Samuelsson is a former Quakeworld professional player. Belonging to the old guard, he was considered an all-rounder with impeccable knowledge of both [[4on4]] and [[1on1]].

In [[2006]], he showed up for [[QHLAN 9]] like jack-in-the-box and eventually beat {{Player|reppie|flag=nl}} in the Grand Final.

